{"full":"hf:marcosomma79/orka-reasoning","spaceId":"marcosomma79/orka-reasoning","name":"Orka Reasoning","source":"huggingface","description":"An interactive AI application on Hugging Face Spaces.","category":"AI & machine learning","language":"HTML","topics":["static","region:us"],"technologies":[],"likes":7,"created":"2025-09-23T14:08:04.000Z","updated":"2025-11-11T16:04:08.000Z","license":null,"runtime":"RUNNING","appUrl":"https://marcosomma79-orka-reasoning.static.hf.space/","demo":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/marcosomma79/orka-reasoning","availability":"available","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:46.017Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:46.017Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:46.017Z","color":"#3c3250","ink":"#e4d4ff","symbol":"🧠","overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["| A Cognitive AI Framework for Transparent, Traceable Thinking","Artificial intelligence in 2025 is still dominated by single-model prompting. Most systems wrap an LLM with thin layers of tooling, producing outputs that are fluent but fragile. These pipelines lack transparency, cannot explain their reasoning, and often collapse under real-world complexity. Developers are forced to treat large models as black boxes, while users are left with results they cannot audit or challenge. What is missing is a framework that treats reasoning as a process to be observed, critiqued, and improved, rather than a one-shot output to be consumed.","OrKa-reasoning was created to address this gap. It is not a prompt wrapper but a cognitive framework that orchestrates multiple agents, layered memory, and iterative debate loops into transparent reasoning flows. Inspired by Marvin Minsky’s idea of a Society of Mind, OrKa treats intelligence as an emergent property of collaboration and critique among specialized roles. In recent traces, we see agents taking progressive, conservative, realist, and purist positions, debating and refining perspectives before converging on shared ground. This is reasoning that is no longer hidden inside a single…"],"features":[],"sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/marcosomma79/orka-reasoning/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"d55b98ee039bd383145682aa89e3aeecea34f82600a421bc8141d430b7b04631","extractedAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:46.056Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:46.056Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"| A Cognitive AI Framework for Transparent, Traceable Thinking","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/marcosomma79/orka-reasoning/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"d55b98ee039bd383145682aa89e3aeecea34f82600a421bc8141d430b7b04631","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/marcosomma79/orka-reasoning/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:46.056Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2025-11-11T16:04:08.000Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/spaces/marcosomma79/orka-reasoning/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-08T06:35:46.056Z","hash":"d55b98ee039bd383145682aa89e3aeecea34f82600a421bc8141d430b7b04631","originalBytes":24112,"storedBytes":24112,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["reasoning","orka-reasoning","debate","orka","agents","agreement","loop","memory","agent","cognitive","model","loops","orchestration","simple","final","framework","get","each","instead","intelligence","response","single","system","benchmark","flows","graphscout","how","score","society","structured","their","answer","answers","execution","gpt-oss","minsky","prompt","run","these","traces","transparent","accuracy","across","benchmarks","completed","early","iterative","mind","models","opaque","outputs","such","through","toward","treats","truth","what","without","already","before","beta","calls","cognition.","conservative","convergence.","critique","define","demonstrates","else","ethical","executes","explain","explainable","inspired","introduces","itself","layers","llm","llms","logged","marvin","math","memories","modular","multiple",